# aisha shellcheck policy
#
# Disabled checks (style/info level, intentional patterns):
#   SC2001 — sed-based substitutions are used deliberately where the patterns
#            (backrefs, char classes) exceed ${var//…} capabilities
#   SC2012 — ls is used on controlled, self-generated filenames (step_N.json)
#   SC2016 — single-quoted $HOME in the installer is intentional: the rc-file
#            snippet must expand at shell startup, not at install time
#   SC2059 — ANSI color variables are deliberately placed in printf format
#            strings; arguments are never user-controlled format strings
#   SC2129 — individual >> redirects in the installer favor readability
disable=SC2001,SC2012,SC2016,SC2059,SC2129
